From bb9b0c3689b00c970db7ed83ca382237d599187e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nickkostik <161902345+nickkostik@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 01:41:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Embed new Pencil strokes in saved PDF pages

Write Pencil ink from the current editing session as vector page content so readers and printers that omit annotations can draw handwritten signatures. Preserve existing annotations and keep a separate editable save path.

Stage the PDF before replacing the destination and clear edits only when the saved revision reaches that destination. Verify that placement, forms, and protected documents survive the save round trip.
